{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["KAMITSUBAKI CITY UNDER CONSTRUCTION","Seven years after humanity was devastated by a major disaster, a beacon of science and prosperity rises in Kamitsubaki City. But lurking in its shadows are Tesseractor, monsters born from human darkness. Only the Witchling, five girls with voices that wield magic, stand against them. With every note, they fight, not just to protect the peace of the city, but to heal a broken world.\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\n\nNotes:\n\n• Announced in the \"Kamitsubaki Yoyogi Kessen 2024: V.W.P 2nd ONE-MAN LIVE - Genshou II\" Day 1 concert.\n\n• Includes Episode 0."],"ja":["神椿市建設中。",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-57820","ids":{"shikimori":57820,"mal":57820,"anilist":173335,"kodik":"serial-68250"},"kodikIds":["serial-68206","serial-68724","serial-68250"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-68206":"2025-09-25T19:37:30Z","serial-68724":"2025-09-25T20:12:12Z","serial-68250":"2025-07-04T20:41:31Z"},"title":"Строящийся город Камицубаки","originalTitle":"Kamitsubaki-shi Kensetsuchuu.","alt":"Kamitsubaki City Under Construction KAMITSUBAKI CITY UNDER CONSTRUCTION 神椿市建設中。","description":"Спустя семь лет после катастрофы, чуть не стёршей человечество с лица земли, в Камицубаки-Сити расцветает маяк науки и процветания. Но в тенях этого города таятся Тессерактор — монстры, рождённые из тьмы человеческих душ. Противостоять им способны лишь Ведьмочки — пять девушек, чьи голоса наделены магической силой. Каждой нотой они вступают в бой не только за мир и покой родного города, но и за исцеление всего израненного мира.","year":2025,"type":"TV","genres":["Фантастика","Музыка"],"rating":5.78,"popularity":6691,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/57820/dd7af978fbcffb51e62b517af2179fa6.jpeg","width":685,"height":975},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/173335-GNOmbqSZUuBa.jpg","width":1900,"height":40